Each bottle is provided with an eco-friendly bottle cleaner to clean the insides of your bottle. You can use soaked tamarind to clean your bottle. For stubborn stains, add some lime juice along with soaked tamarind. Avoid using chemical cleaning agents to clean the bottle. Do not use hot water to clean your bottle.

